I am in my kitchen now.
There are three heavy bags on the counter.
I thank Asha.
She is very kind.
I am very happy.
I open the bags one by one.
First, I take out the rice and dal.
I put the rice and dal in the big boxes.
Then I take out the fresh vegetables.
I like tomatoes and spinach a lot.
I put the vegetables in the fridge.
Now I take out the small plastic packets.
These are the spices from the kirana shop.
I have a new steel masala dabba.
I need spices for dinner.
I open the packets of turmeric, cumin, and salt.
I put the spices in the box.
My masala dabba looks very beautiful.
Now my kitchen is full.
I am ready to make my first real dinner.
